+   *                               *          *                               *
+   *********************************          *********************************
+
+   GMEM = GPU Memory (e.g. HBM)
+   CMEM = CPU Memory (e.g. LPDDR5X)
+
+  |
+  | Following table contains traffic coverage of Grace SoC PMU in socket-A:
+
+  ::
+
