+   |              |PCI R/W|Translated,|Translated | CPU | CPU/PCIE1| GPU/PCIE2|
+   |              |       |EGM        |           |     |          |          |
+   +==============+=======+===========+===========+=====+==========+==========+
+   | Local        | PCIE  |NVLink-C2C0|NVLink-C2C1| SCF | SCF PMU  | CNVLink  |
+   | SYSRAM/CMEM  | PMU   |PMU        |PMU        | PMU |          | PMU      |
