+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/display/msm/qcom,eliza-mdss.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: Qualcomm Eliza SoC Display MDSS
+
+maintainers:
+  - Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzk@kernel.org>
+
